{"skill":{"slug":"openclaw-slides","displayName":"openclaw-slides"},"version":{"version":"2.0.0","createdAt":1774681996632,"changelog":"Update ecosystem links to myclaw.ai/skills","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"README.de.md","size":2093,"sha256":"75bae16ab3daa7f57bd7dc0c87b209290c0010cfdcefd3c1b645a3e2ecf27c4b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"README.es.md","size":2074,"sha256":"c9f4d2202b12ae44d458e16a52a7f853c491473a85228c80c6c687860999db93","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"README.fr.md","size":2082,"sha256":"a801b2b186d858a80d60fd4ff5a2e94d537bc897289e62acb59dd1fe86933c79","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"README.it.md","size":2013,"sha256":"064bf0d713c00480990e81724206db9234b1b0501781cdae76b91f45bb41f9e8","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"README.ja.md","size":2306,"sha256":"5483f618f332944fa4f85cfbe1a2d21594358b5b178068c49364864a6800e93c","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"README.md","size":3949,"sha256":"e7c91375fc019c52079578e6f97e94809b4fbaa07c8b59c44999456ae08f7419","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"README.ru.md","size":2709,"sha256":"1d3bed6cde860e38a656a231de8fbb2e060c14e87b5677bea6fc14461cdfd1ae","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"README.zh-CN.md","size":3637,"sha256":"68cde9efcc598b55847e2f4e11bbe57d54ded2a09472a588dbd20f4136e61de0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":13417,"sha256":"81ad47347c91c4aae01a4ec198a08706f7b78a70826fa201bd3853daa1752939","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"_meta.json","size":134,"sha256":"7a3db3484bcc9e2db1f7f21118f02393b01944b578825a66a15d9aae45afa2cf","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"references/STYLE_PRESETS.md","size":13934,"sha256":"985f63e54fe8bd1cde15dce0c60dc3a64f877e83d1308626d4b7e91c6d4876b0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2263,"sha256":"82021a09bdb536ace9d0053c171631a364b0a88b4127302d5db6b8216b5421e4","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789098882304,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"a54f626ddba068d7bbc6420f6a38c542c0f27f46b1a40b29f3fba20b0e2b19e0","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/a54f626ddba068d7bbc6420f6a38c542c0f27f46b1a40b29f3fba20b0e2b19e0","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780085624029},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":38,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":11,"checkedAt":1789098882304},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"medium","summary":"This skill is a presentation generator/converter whose file access and optional dependencies mostly match its stated purpose, with some install and privacy caveats users should understand.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Local reads of images, HTML, and PPT/PPTX files are proportionate to conversion and enhancement, and the artifact says image processing is local; generated presentations may still load external font resources despite offline/self-contained claims.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill declares an optional shell install of unpinned python-pptx and Pillow via pip for PPT conversion/image processing, which is purpose-aligned but has normal supply-chain and environment-mutation risk.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The activation examples are broad presentation requests, but the runtime instructions ask for user preferences, confirmation of image assignments, and confirmation of extracted slide structure before generation.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"There is no system-level persistence, privilege escalation, service installation, credential access, or background worker behavior; optional inline editing stores presentation text in browser localStorage.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill consistently describes creating HTML slide decks, converting PowerPoint files, processing user-provided images locally, and generating preview/output files; those capabilities fit the stated presentation workflow.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable with the agent reading presentation/image files you provide and generating local HTML/assets. Approve optional pip installs only in an environment where unpinned Python packages are acceptable, and avoid remote-font presets or bundle fonts locally if viewer privacy or offline use matters. Use inline editing only if browser localStorage persistence is acceptable for the deck content.","findings":"[T08] expected: The unpinned pip install is a real supply-chain caveat, but it is optional, disclosed, and tied to PPT conversion/image processing rather than hidden execution.\n[T08] expected: External font providers support the style presets, but they weaken the self-contained/offline claim and may expose routine browser request metadata when a generated deck is opened.\n[SQP-1] expected: Broad natural-language examples could cause loose routing, but they are ordinary presentation/deck requests and do not introduce unrelated authority.\n[SQP-2] expected: Processing user-provided PPT/images and writing generated HTML is expected; localized READMEs could disclose file handling more clearly, and localStorage persistence is only briefly disclosed.\n[SQP-3] expected: Localized README language and the sample html lang attribute are usability/localization issues, not evidence of unsafe behavior.\n[AE4] expected: Inspection of the localized README content found multilingual text and branding but no hidden instructions, secrets, or obfuscated unsafe behavior.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789098882304}}}}}